  "broader": "https://granitestate.github.io/rules/lab/802",
  "definition": "\"Personnel file\" as used in RSA 275:56 means any personnel records created and maintained by an employer and pertaining to an employee including and not limited",
  "effectiveDate": "2016-04-11",
  "historyNote": "#7007, eff 5-26-99; ss by #8879, INTERIM, eff 5-18-07, EXPIRES: 11-14-07; ss by #9024, eff 11-9-07; ss by #11070, eff 4-11-16 (from Lab 802.09)",
